WEBVTT

00:00:01.530 --> 00:00:03.260
Let's fight, Ren.

00:00:03.560 --> 00:00:05.770
I'm going to beat you, and that power,

00:00:06.350 --> 00:00:08.790
and bring back the person you used to be.

00:00:08.790 --> 00:00:10.260
I swear by this!

00:00:10.550 --> 00:00:14.340
If you're going to get in my 
way, I'll bring you to your knees.

00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:18.580
With this power that you refuse to accept!

00:00:21.520 --> 00:00:25.920
I never thought the day would come when 
the three of us would gather here again.

00:00:26.480 --> 00:00:28.530
But everything has changed.

00:00:28.530 --> 00:00:31.260
Kai, you have zero chance of winning.

00:00:31.800 --> 00:00:35.810
You can't even imagine 
how powerful Ren is now.

00:00:35.980 --> 00:00:38.480
Show your true form!

00:00:38.480 --> 00:00:39.610
Crossride!

00:00:40.990 --> 00:00:44.420
Dragonic Overlord The End!

00:00:49.800 --> 00:00:52.150
On top of Dragonic Overlord?

00:00:53.490 --> 00:00:57.400
This is Dragonic Overlord's final form...

00:00:57.400 --> 00:00:58.720
Its true form!

00:00:59.530 --> 00:01:03.070
Ren, I'm gonna bring you back with this!

00:02:38.280 --> 00:02:40.720
Dragonic Overlord The End...

00:02:41.310 --> 00:02:44.270
When you ride it on top of Dragonic Overlord,

00:02:44.660 --> 00:02:46.330
it receives +2000 power.

00:02:46.630 --> 00:02:48.820
That makes the total 13000!

00:02:49.510 --> 00:02:54.390
Crossride... I never knew there 
was a unit that could do that...

00:02:54.390 --> 00:02:55.770
That's amazing, Kai!

00:02:58.350 --> 00:03:01.620
Did you know? Is that why you 
came here to watch the fight?

00:03:02.170 --> 00:03:04.550
No. I didn't know either.

00:03:06.030 --> 00:03:08.870
At any rate, he surprises me.

00:03:09.860 --> 00:03:14.020
He not only woke up Aichi Sendou 
from the spell of Psyqualia,

00:03:14.020 --> 00:03:17.150
he's even mastered a unit that can crossride.

00:03:18.520 --> 00:03:23.480
With all that ability, why 
doesn't he have Psyqualia?

00:03:23.480 --> 00:03:24.800
I'm very interested.

00:03:25.580 --> 00:03:30.550
Clash! Overlord

00:03:33.540 --> 00:03:37.570
It's like seeing two former friends step beyond 
the bounds of time to fight each other once again.

00:03:37.570 --> 00:03:39.560
Putting their faith on the line...

00:03:40.560 --> 00:03:44.050
I may be the only one here enjoying this.

00:03:44.840 --> 00:03:49.240
Though their viewpoints, their purpose, 
and everything else has changed,

00:03:49.240 --> 00:03:52.290
it looks like the essence of 
the fight these two produce...

00:03:53.230 --> 00:03:55.290
...remains the same.

00:03:56.810 --> 00:03:59.070
I probably see it through 
rose-colored glasses...

00:03:59.810 --> 00:04:00.770
Except...

00:04:01.170 --> 00:04:04.190
Those two used to have more fun back then.

00:04:07.860 --> 00:04:09.050
You're leaving.

00:04:09.830 --> 00:04:11.620
And you're staying, huh?

00:04:12.320 --> 00:04:15.000
I can't desert Ren.

00:04:15.730 --> 00:04:16.730
I see...

00:04:18.870 --> 00:04:23.500
Ever since the day Kai walked out on us,

00:04:25.150 --> 00:04:26.470
Ren has been out of control.

00:05:03.380 --> 00:05:06.030
He spent all his time fighting,

00:05:06.030 --> 00:05:08.520
relying solely on that power.

00:05:09.130 --> 00:05:12.270
To forget the loneliness of Kai leaving...

00:05:12.270 --> 00:05:15.060
To drown out his anger towards Kai...

00:05:15.060 --> 00:05:18.670
To prove that he was right 
in choosing that power...

00:05:21.790 --> 00:05:25.370
Kai, Ren, me...

00:05:25.370 --> 00:05:28.240
None of us are wrong.

00:05:28.240 --> 00:05:32.230
This is the result of each of us 
choosing a path to believe in.

00:05:36.070 --> 00:05:41.370
From the day they first met, Kai 
and Ren understood each other.

00:05:41.370 --> 00:05:43.560
Those two got along so well

00:05:43.560 --> 00:05:46.710
that I sometimes felt jealousy towards 
Kai for stealing my oldest friend.

00:05:50.960 --> 00:05:54.770
At a glance, it looks like their 
personalities are totally different,

00:05:55.410 --> 00:06:00.220
but they both hate anything crooked, and 
they both stick to the decisions they've made.

00:06:01.650 --> 00:06:02.810
And also,

00:06:03.490 --> 00:06:05.730
they value their friends more than anything.

00:06:09.850 --> 00:06:16.350
Ren devoted himself to getting strong 
for Kai, me, the three of us...

00:06:17.250 --> 00:06:18.290
That's right.

00:06:18.750 --> 00:06:21.700
He obtained power

00:06:21.700 --> 00:06:25.520
to help all of us. That's all it was about.

00:06:26.720 --> 00:06:31.030
And Kai walked out on Ren for Ren's own good.

00:06:31.880 --> 00:06:36.010
He didn't think he could snap Ren out 
of it unless he got strong on his own.

00:06:36.310 --> 00:06:39.110
That's why he chose to leave Ren.

00:06:39.960 --> 00:06:43.420
I couldn't wake Ren up, either.

00:06:43.420 --> 00:06:45.570
That's why I stayed.

00:06:45.770 --> 00:06:47.860
Walking side by side...

00:06:47.860 --> 00:06:50.840
That was the only thing 
I could do for my friend.

00:06:51.170 --> 00:06:55.330
As a result, we and Kai 
went down different paths.

00:06:57.330 --> 00:06:59.680
However this fight is settled...

00:07:00.730 --> 00:07:02.630
I have to see it through to the end,

00:07:03.610 --> 00:07:06.030
as their friend and as a fighter.

00:07:11.390 --> 00:07:15.350
By crossriding Dragonic Overlord The End,

00:07:15.850 --> 00:07:17.750
its power is 13000.

00:07:18.210 --> 00:07:21.180
With this, I'm going to beat 
you and your Psyqualia.

00:07:21.180 --> 00:07:23.620
Ren, I'm going to bring 
you back down to Earth!

00:07:28.220 --> 00:07:29.480
I call Bahr.

00:07:30.160 --> 00:07:32.270
With a boost from Conroe,

00:07:32.270 --> 00:07:35.610
Burning Horn attacks Fatalita!

00:07:36.300 --> 00:07:38.270
With a boost from Flame of Hope, Aermo...

00:07:39.330 --> 00:07:40.930
The End attacks!

00:07:44.660 --> 00:07:46.410
Check the drive trigger.

00:08:01.600 --> 00:08:02.780
Not yet...

00:08:02.920 --> 00:08:05.810
When an attack boosted by Aermo hits,

00:08:06.090 --> 00:08:08.810
I can discard one unit from 
my hand to activate its skill!

00:08:09.760 --> 00:08:10.590
Draw.

00:08:16.260 --> 00:08:18.140
The End isn't finished.

00:08:18.820 --> 00:08:20.740
It uses its own reflection...

00:08:21.410 --> 00:08:22.990
Persona Blast!

00:08:35.490 --> 00:08:37.760
The End... stood?

00:08:40.680 --> 00:08:46.770
When its attack hits, The End can stand 
again by discarding one more of the same unit.

00:08:47.230 --> 00:08:50.800
That's right. Its true form 
appears from behind the mask.

00:08:58.650 --> 00:09:01.240
Which one am I rooting for?

00:09:03.630 --> 00:09:06.250
Go back to being the guy you used to be!

00:09:13.850 --> 00:09:14.800
Ren!

00:10:09.500 --> 00:10:12.220
Go back to being the guy you used to be!

00:10:17.890 --> 00:10:18.800
Ren!

00:10:48.110 --> 00:10:48.710
Guard.

00:10:49.270 --> 00:10:51.030
Death Feather Eagle.

00:10:58.870 --> 00:11:00.830
Check the drive trigger.

00:11:03.340 --> 00:11:05.210
Got a critical trigger!

00:11:05.820 --> 00:11:08.020
I give all the effects to Berserk Dragon.

00:11:16.070 --> 00:11:18.230
He guarded against The End's attack!

00:11:19.670 --> 00:11:22.980
There's still Berserk 
Dragon with a 2 critical!

00:11:24.250 --> 00:11:25.720
That's our Ren.

00:11:29.540 --> 00:11:32.220
Berserk attacks with a boost from Bahr!

00:11:32.660 --> 00:11:35.730
I guard with Abyss Freezer 
and Blaster Javelin.

00:11:36.390 --> 00:11:38.450
DonnerSchlag intercepts.

00:11:49.020 --> 00:11:50.860
He blocked that one, too!

00:11:59.420 --> 00:12:00.720
Turn end!

00:12:06.060 --> 00:12:07.350
Kai...

00:12:08.460 --> 00:12:12.520
Even though he did a crossride with 
The End and a Persona Blast...

00:12:13.820 --> 00:12:17.450
I guess Ren Suzugamori's strength 
is the real thing, huh?

00:12:17.500 --> 00:12:17.980
Yes.

00:12:18.470 --> 00:12:20.300
Yep! He is impressive!

00:12:20.870 --> 00:12:23.020
Too bad, Kai.

00:12:23.020 --> 00:12:26.280
But I knew this would happen.

00:12:27.080 --> 00:12:27.910
This...

00:12:29.710 --> 00:12:31.450
...Psyqualia.

00:12:33.810 --> 00:12:36.790
I also know that you're 
going to lose this turn.

00:12:37.850 --> 00:12:39.120
Final Turn!

00:12:49.980 --> 00:12:53.620
Kai, you're not the only 
one with a trump card.

00:12:54.630 --> 00:12:55.420
Don't tell me...

00:12:57.580 --> 00:13:00.810
Crying out in despair in the 
chaos that is silence...

00:13:00.810 --> 00:13:05.320
The power of shadowy darkness, 
obscuring all vision, is mine.

00:13:05.600 --> 00:13:07.280
I crossride...

00:13:07.280 --> 00:13:09.820
Phantom Blaster Overlord!

00:13:33.350 --> 00:13:36.010
Phantom Blaster Overlord...

00:13:41.850 --> 00:13:43.910
Just like The End,

00:13:43.910 --> 00:13:49.920
when you crossride Phantom Blaster Overlord 
on top of Phantom Blaster Dragon,

00:13:49.920 --> 00:13:51.760
its power is 13000.

00:13:55.230 --> 00:13:57.010
I call Phantom Blaster Dragon...

00:13:59.120 --> 00:14:01.250
...and Blaster Dark.

00:14:03.640 --> 00:14:04.050
Ah!

00:14:04.710 --> 00:14:06.540
I have three Blaster units.

00:14:07.330 --> 00:14:09.250
A grand sight, isn't it?

00:14:13.310 --> 00:14:17.210
I attack Burning Horn 
Dragon with Blaster Dark!

00:14:18.290 --> 00:14:19.240
No guard!

00:14:28.800 --> 00:14:32.280
Well, are you ready, Kai?

00:14:37.290 --> 00:14:39.260
With a boost from Apocalypse,

00:14:39.890 --> 00:14:42.890
Phantom Blaster Overlord attacks!

00:14:45.880 --> 00:14:48.110
Apocalypse's Soulblast.

00:14:49.970 --> 00:14:51.990
+6000 power!

00:14:55.750 --> 00:14:57.000
And...

00:14:59.690 --> 00:15:04.230
No! Like The End, Phantom 
Blaster Overlord can...

00:15:09.890 --> 00:15:12.060
I send its reflection to the drop zone...

00:15:12.890 --> 00:15:14.520
Persona Blast!

00:15:19.380 --> 00:15:22.830
When Phantom Blaster Overlord attacks,

00:15:22.830 --> 00:15:25.860
if you discard the same unit from your hand,

00:15:25.860 --> 00:15:27.720
it receives +10000 power

00:15:27.720 --> 00:15:29.790
and an extra critical.

00:15:36.770 --> 00:15:38.340
He has a critical of 2!

00:15:38.340 --> 00:15:40.050
If this one hits...

00:15:40.360 --> 00:15:41.800
...Ren wins.

00:15:48.550 --> 00:15:50.250
I can't lose!

00:15:52.100 --> 00:15:55.490
I guard with two units of Blu-ray 
Dracokid and Burning Horn!

00:16:00.580 --> 00:16:02.580
38000 defense...

00:16:02.580 --> 00:16:03.640
With that, he can...

00:16:06.090 --> 00:16:07.470
It's no use.

00:16:07.900 --> 00:16:09.480
Check the drive trigger.

00:16:14.090 --> 00:16:16.660
Got a critical trigger.

00:16:20.180 --> 00:16:21.700
Oh, no...

00:16:24.440 --> 00:16:28.630
I add +5000 to the power 
of Phantom Blaster Overlord

00:16:28.630 --> 00:16:30.680
and give it the extra critical.

00:16:34.750 --> 00:16:37.540
38000 power and a critical of 3?

00:16:39.960 --> 00:16:41.350
Is it over?

00:16:44.960 --> 00:16:46.610
End of the line?

00:16:47.250 --> 00:16:49.790
Phantom Blaster Overlord...

00:16:50.710 --> 00:16:53.160
...delivers its final blow to The End!

00:17:04.740 --> 00:17:06.710
That makes 7 damage.

00:17:07.080 --> 00:17:12.150
Kai, the only way for you to survive 
is if you draw two heal triggers.

00:17:16.920 --> 00:17:18.360
I will!

00:17:19.510 --> 00:17:20.390
Check.

00:17:23.600 --> 00:17:26.110
It's not over yet. Second check!

00:17:27.140 --> 00:17:28.710
Got a heal trigger!

00:17:35.420 --> 00:17:37.780
I add +5000 to the power of The End....

00:17:39.580 --> 00:17:41.650
...and heal 1 point of damage.

00:17:43.800 --> 00:17:46.130
You have one check left.

00:17:52.610 --> 00:17:57.750
I've been searching all this time for the 
strength to beat you... for this day...

00:18:08.690 --> 00:18:11.080
I'm going to draw it. I'll show you!

00:18:11.080 --> 00:18:13.280
And then I'm going to...

00:18:13.280 --> 00:18:14.500
Third check!

00:18:29.200 --> 00:18:30.720
No trigger, huh?

00:18:51.490 --> 00:18:53.170
I win.

00:18:54.140 --> 00:18:56.210
Kai lost...?

00:18:56.930 --> 00:18:58.960
Looks like you got what you wished for.

00:18:59.600 --> 00:19:02.210
I'm not wishing for anything.

00:19:02.210 --> 00:19:03.450
You know, don't you?

00:19:04.870 --> 00:19:07.710
Everything depends on the 
guidance of the cards.

00:19:14.790 --> 00:19:17.070
I won, just like I said I would.

00:19:17.930 --> 00:19:21.040
Everything happened the 
way Psyqualia showed me.

00:19:23.320 --> 00:19:26.760
Our friendship ended that day.

00:19:27.270 --> 00:19:28.530
It's too late to go back.

00:19:30.730 --> 00:19:32.310
The End!

00:19:33.180 --> 00:19:34.100
Ren...

00:19:34.620 --> 00:19:39.250
Kai, you're of no value to me anymore.

00:19:39.250 --> 00:19:42.040
All I need is Psyqualia.

00:19:47.060 --> 00:19:48.680
I'm grateful.

00:19:48.680 --> 00:19:52.500
Thank you for giving me this 
Phantom Blaster Overlord.

00:20:09.790 --> 00:20:12.040
Suiko, you gave that to Ren?

00:20:12.670 --> 00:20:18.240
Of course, even without this, 
my victory was never in doubt.

00:20:18.850 --> 00:20:19.910
Why?

00:20:20.850 --> 00:20:24.000
We need his power.

00:20:24.880 --> 00:20:27.600
Even though that power changed Ren?!

00:20:28.040 --> 00:20:31.950
We don't care whether the results 
of the power are good or bad.

00:20:32.540 --> 00:20:35.380
There are things that only 
someone with the power can do.

00:20:41.550 --> 00:20:44.530
I'm going to use this 
power to take everything.

00:20:44.830 --> 00:20:47.110
And nothing can stop me.

00:20:47.930 --> 00:20:49.220
<i>No one.</i>

00:20:51.390 --> 00:20:52.480
Kai...

00:20:57.000 --> 00:20:58.150
Ren!

00:21:00.310 --> 00:21:03.670
Kai, this is the path that Ren chose.

00:21:08.480 --> 00:21:09.310
Ren!

00:21:14.720 --> 00:21:15.140
Kai!

00:21:15.620 --> 00:21:16.410
Get away from me!

00:21:18.470 --> 00:21:20.020
Leave me alone!

00:21:28.180 --> 00:21:29.590
Suiko...

00:21:30.080 --> 00:21:35.160
Ren Suzugamori's Psyqualia has 
become extremely powerful.

00:21:35.540 --> 00:21:38.810
Powerful enough to change the world...

00:21:44.770 --> 00:21:47.880
Ren Suzugamori chose a card of darkness.

00:21:48.840 --> 00:21:51.060
Light that consumes the darkness...

00:21:51.060 --> 00:21:53.210
Darkness that blankets the light...

00:21:53.660 --> 00:21:56.930
Aichi Sendou, which do you choose?

00:22:14.830 --> 00:22:15.770
I choose...

00:23:50.700 --> 00:23:52.410
I never thought Kai would lose!

00:23:52.410 --> 00:23:54.380
Why are you surprised?

00:23:54.380 --> 00:23:59.210
Kai doesn't have Psyqualia, so 
of course he's no match for me.

00:23:59.210 --> 00:24:00.870
What should I do?

00:24:00.870 --> 00:24:02.990
Surrender to Psyqualia.

00:24:03.030 --> 00:24:05.220
Forget Kai and join me.

00:24:05.720 --> 00:24:08.110
I'll be waiting.

00:24:08.110 --> 00:24:13.030
The national tournament final... Can 
I fight against Ren without Psyqualia?

00:24:13.030 --> 00:24:15.450
Next time: Fighting for the Top Spot!

00:24:15.450 --> 00:24:17.040
Please, give me an image...

00:24:17.040 --> 00:24:18.830
of the power to fight!
